    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat">
      <span class="num">2025</span>
      <span class="lbl">Founded in Dumaguete</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{# STORY #}
<section class="about-story">
  <div class="story-text">
    <h2>Our <em>Story</em></h2>
    <p>Founded in 2025 in the heart of Dumaguete City, EcoBrew Café started as a small stall at the weekend market with a single espresso machine, two farmers' agreements, and a dream to prove that sustainable business is also brilliant business.</p>
    <p>Today we serve over 2,400 customers monthly, partner with 12 farming cooperatives across Mindanao and Visayas, and have diverted 98% of our waste from landfill. But we're just getting started.</p>
    <p>Our founder, Hyzl-Ann Estrabela, spent 10 years working in coffee export before realizing the industry's environmental blind spots. EcoBrew is her answer — and yours — to doing things differently.</p>
    <a href="{{ path('contact') }}" class="btn-primary">Get in Touch →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="story-right">
    <div class="story-photo">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509042239860-f550ce710b93?w=900&q=85&auto=format&fit=crop"
        alt="Barista crafting a drink at EcoBrew"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="story-photo-badge">🌿 Sustainably Sourced</div>
