      <span class="value-emoji">💚</span>
      <h3>Wellness Focus</h3>
      <p>Our goal is to support your well-being with every refreshing sip.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <span class="value-emoji">🌍</span>
      <h3>Planet-Friendly</h3>
      <p>We create feel-good drinks that are good for you and kind to the planet.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# PHOTO STRIP #}
